OL,5,G2200 24 Hours in A&E
OL,6,     FAnita, who's 44, is rushed to
OL,7,     FQueen's after having a cardiac
OL,8,     Farrest at home. Bob's 94. He has a
OL,9,     Fhead injury. And five-year-old
OL,10,     FLottie's injured her leg while
OL,11,     Fdancing with her mum.
OL,12,G2305 999: On the Front Line
OL,13,     FParamedics have to change their
OL,14,     Fplans when a pregnant woman's
OL,15,     Fwaters break at home. And a
OL,16,     Fdaughter's worried about her mum,
OL,17,     Fwho's collapsed and is confused.
